 ## Development log
 
+### 2026-10-29: Stage 340 (isolated Dual Wield prototype)
+- Local derivative by Codex for a passive Dual Wield ability, not an upstream release.
+- One new ability (126, zero AP, initially unequipped); no other rewards, renames or AP grants.
+- Current KH1 weapon duplicated with the native loader; no form weapon slot or inventory copy.
+- Valor base ground rows only; native air, casting, movement, model and colours retained.
+- No Drive menu, gauge, drain, transformation, growth abilities, stats, camera, HUD or shortcut patches.
+- Both blades use the imported ground windows by default; optional offhand-only contact isolation.
+- Built/tested locally with substituted/synthetic data; live KH1 validation remains required.
+
 ### 2026-10-07: milestone 1
 - Surveyed existing work: OpenKH (format docs and C# readers), GovanifY/kh2 (PS2 decomp, early
   stage), KHPCPatchManager. Chose documented formats; no decompiling was needed.
